ncies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]link_protocol: extend bob-cli's editor-facing parse and completion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contracts with a shared, vault-aware Obsidian wikilink scanner, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note/alias/heading/block discovery, byte-exact replacements, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deterministic ranking, additive JSON metadata, documentation, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exhaustive Rust coverage while preserving existing capture behavior and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the lexical no-I/O guarantee of capture-parse.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Caret-correct link intelligence in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]caret_integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after link_protocol[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]caret_integration: update the linked bob-mac-capture app to decode the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]additive contract, drive completion from the real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AttributedTextSelection insertion point, preserve selection and IME [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state while applying highlights, accept server-provided replacements [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a restored caret, and harden cancellation, stale-response, Unicode,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and failure behavior with fixture-backed Swift tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Beautiful, accessible completion presentation and release gate[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual_polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after caret_integration[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual_polish: refine the popup's wikilink palette and completion rows [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into an adaptive native macOS experience with clear [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note/path/alias/subpath hierarchy, matched-result emphasis, keyboard and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]VoiceOver feedback, responsive sizing, documentation, automated [/#D7D7AF]\